      "message": "We have 128KB SRAM to work with. We\u0027ll enforce the following at link time:\n\n- RO (and RW..) image size \u003c CONFIG_RO_SIZE\n- Image size + RAM usage \u003c 128KB\n\nSince we reduced RAM usage by reducing the stack size, we now have extra space that images can use without going over the 128KB boundary.",
